# Theme system — verified tokens, contrast audit, font recipe

Working design system extracted from a verified Floki WebChat build
(`~/Desktop/model/gemma4/webchat/`). Four swappable design languages,
all WCAG AA-pass for normal text, all switchable via topbar tablist,
all persisted to the `settings` table.

## The four themes (one-line identity)

| Key | Name | bg | accent | Hero font | Radius | Identity |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `dark` | Dark (default) | `#0f1117` | `#7c5cff` | system sans | 10px | Modern dev-tool SaaS |
| `light` | Light | `#f7f8fa` | `#7c5cff` | system sans | 10px | Same purple, white bg |
| `terminal` | Terminal — phosphor mono | `#0a0e0a` | `#00ff9c` | JetBrains Mono | 2px | CRT/phosphor, sharp 1.5px borders, 0.2s typing animation feel |
| `brutalist` | Brutalist — pure B/W | `#ffffff` | `#b42922` | IBM Plex Mono | 0px | High contrast, no shadows, 2px black borders, instant cuts |

## Full token table

